    "result": "```gq\nquery recent_docs_within_radius($q: Vector(3), $r: F64) {\n    match {\n        $d: Doc\n        $d.year >= 2025\n        nearest($d.embedding, $q) <= $r\n    }\n    return { $d.title, nearest($d.embedding, $q) as distance }\n    order { nearest($d.embedding, $q) }\n    limit 10\n}\n```",
